WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:10.816
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:10.817 --> 00:00:17.360
What do they see?

3
00:00:17.361 --> 00:00:20.799
They see a gift shop.

4
00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:40.057
The blobs go inside.

5
00:00:40.058 --> 00:01:02.867
They get four T-shirts.

6
00:01:02.868 --> 00:01:18.441
They get four caps.

7
00:01:18.442 --> 00:01:29.097
They get four balloons.

8
00:01:29.098 --> 00:01:40.099
They get four cups.

9
00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:55.782
They get four bags.

10
00:01:55.783 --> 00:02:02.047
But there are only three blobs.

11
00:02:02.048 --> 00:02:07.476
Look! They get a teddy bear!

12
00:02:07.477 --> 00:02:13.636
Blobs, what are you doing?

13
00:02:13.637 --> 00:02:18.566
Click! They take a picture!

14
00:02:18.567 --> 00:02:22.131
Silly blobs!

15
00:02:22.132 --> 00:02:25.301
Good-bye!

